{
  "_about": "The free-placed level objects, shared by the game (level_data.gd, level_geometry.gd, grid_nav.gd) and the level editor. Sizes are metres. on_cell: what an object sitting square on a cell does to it ('wall' = counts as a wall for nav / lighting but no solid block is built; 'open' = punches a walkable opening through a wall). blocks_nav: when placed off-centre, the monster can't path across its span. A new structural type needs a builder in level_geometry.gd _build_objects(); the editor draws unknown types as a plain slab. A type with a 'model' key is instead a decorative clutter prop: level_geometry.gd's generic _build_props() instances that FBX/GLB and builds a PBR material from 'textures' (albedo/normal/roughness/metallic/emissive), no per-type builder needed. 'scatter': true marks it eligible for the level editor's random SCATTER PROPS tool. 'scale' on these objects (0.5-4.0, same field as thin_wall/arch width) is reused as a uniform size multiplier.",
  "thin_wall": {
    "label": "Thin wall",
    "key": "4",
    "color": "4f493e",
    "help": "A slim partition",
    "thickness": 0.3,
    "on_cell": "wall",
    "blocks_nav": true
  },
  "arch": {
    "label": "Arch",
    "key": "5",
    "color": "7a5f36",
    "help": "A round-topped opening through a full wall. Put it square on a wall cell to punch through it",
    "thickness": 4.5,
    "pillar": 0.75,
    "on_cell": "open",
    "blocks_nav": false
  },
  "door": {
    "label": "Door",
    "key": "6",
    "color": "c0602a",
    "help": "A framed wood door set in its own thin wall; opens as you approach",
    "thickness": 0.3,
    "opening": 1.12,
    "on_cell": "wall",
    "blocks_nav": true
  },
  "stairs_up": {
    "label": "Stairs up",
    "key": "7",
    "color": "3fd1a0",
    "help": "A flight of steps up to the floor above. Walk up it (towards the arrow) to go there; you arrive beside that floor's Stairs down nearest this spot. Put it square on a floor cell",
    "thickness": 4.5,
    "on_cell": "wall",
    "blocks_nav": false,
    "rise": 3.0
  },
  "stairs_down": {
    "label": "Stairs down",
    "key": "8",
    "color": "2f8fd1",
    "help": "A flight of steps down to the floor below, sunk into its cell (the editor makes the cell a pit). Walk down it (towards the arrow) to go there; you arrive beside that floor's Stairs up nearest this spot",
    "thickness": 4.5,
    "blocks_nav": false,
    "rise": 3.0
  },
